  "about": "Hi, I’m Emily Bei Cheng. I explore life at photo pace and share what I’ve experienced through words and images. Occasionally I like to do ultras and I write about that in my essay <a href=\"https://bikepacking.com/plog/japanese-odyssey-voice-memos/\" target=\"_blank\">reflecting on the 2025 Japanese Odyssey</a>.\n\nA goal I have is to share stories and create new routes for the bikepacking community. Here are some selects:\n<a href=\"https://bikepacking.com/routes/iceland-fjallabak-track/\" target=\"_blank\">The Iceland Fjallabak Track</a>\n<a href=\"https://bikepacking.com/routes/bay-area-triple-crossover/\" target=\"_blank\">Bay Area Triple Crossover</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/789628/national-geographic-ultimate-guide-to-the-national-parks-by-national-geographic/\" target=\"_blank\">National Geographic Ultimate Guide to the National Parks photo contributor</a>\n<a href=\"https://bikepacking.com/plog/2022-bikepacking-awards-people-and-routes/\" target=\"_blank\">2023 Bikepacking Awards: Best Route and Collective’s Choice</a>\n<a href=\"https://bikepacking.com/plog/2021-bikepacking-awards-film-photo/\" target=\"_blank\">2021 Bikepacking Awards: Film, Photography, Writing, and Art</a>\n<a href=\"https://trailsmag.net/products/trails-magazine-issue-8\" target=\"_blank\">Trails Magazine Issue 8 Ptarmigan Traverse Photo Feature</a>\n<a href=\"https://theradavist.com/bikepacking-oaxaca/\" target=\"_blank\">The Radavist: Halfway to Oaxaca</a>\n<a href=\"https://theradavist.com/bikepacking-iceland-highlands-on-a-gravel-bike/\" target=\"_blank\">The Radavist: Into the Iceland Highlands</a>\n<a href=\"https://bikepacking.com/news/announcing-bikepacking-journal-11/\" target=\"_blank\">Published in Bikepacking Journal Vol. 8 and 11</a>\n\nConnect with me on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/alpinemily/\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a> ▪ <a href=\"https://www.strava.com/athletes/13320878\" target=\"_blank\">Strava</a> ▪ <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/emcheng/\">LinkedIn</a> ▪ <a href=\"https://github.com/alpinemily\" target=\"_blank\">Github</a> ▪ <a href=\"https://www.peakbagger.com/climber/ClimbListC.aspx?cid=23417&u=ft&j=-1&y=9999&oid=&oname=&sort=ascentdated\" target=\"_blank\">Peakbagger</a>",
